# Backend Guidelines

Rules for all backend, API, and database-related code.

---

## Database
- PostgreSQL is the source of truth
- All write operations must be transactional
- Always scope queries by tenant_id

---

## APIs
- Validate inputs at the API boundary
- Explicitly define allowed state transitions
- Never expose internal IDs without authorization checks

---

## Infrastructure
- AWS services must be accessed via abstractions
- No environment-specific logic in business code
- Use mocks/stubs for local development